10 REM BASIC-58 LED SOS EXAMPLE
11 REM SOS SEQUENCE MORSE CODE S = THREE SHORT FLASHES, O = THREE LONG FLASHES, S = THREE SHORT FLASHES
12 REM 250 MS FOR A SHORT FLASH, 750 MS FOR A LONG FLASH, AND 250 MS BETWEEN FLASHES.
13 REM

20 @SER CONNECT COM10

30 REM S - THREE SHORT FLASHES
40 @SER 18 4 1
50 @DELAY 250
60 @SER 18 4 0
70 @DELAY 250
80 @SER 18 4 1
90 @DELAY 250
100 @SER 18 4 0
110 @DELAY 250
120 @SER 18 4 1
130 @DELAY 250
140 @SER 18 4 0

150 REM LETTER GAP
160 @DELAY 750

170 REM O - THREE LONG FLASHES
180 @SER 18 4 1
190 @DELAY 750
200 @SER 18 4 0
210 @DELAY 250
220 @SER 18 4 1
230 @DELAY 750
240 @SER 18 4 0
250 @DELAY 250
260 @SER 18 4 1
270 @DELAY 750
280 @SER 18 4 0

290 REM LETTER GAP
300 @DELAY 750

310 REM S - THREE SHORT FLASHES
320 @SER 18 4 1
330 @DELAY 250
340 @SER 18 4 0
350 @DELAY 250
360 @SER 18 4 1
370 @DELAY 250
380 @SER 18 4 0
390 @DELAY 250
400 @SER 18 4 1
410 @DELAY 250
420 @SER 18 4 0

430 @SER DISCONNECT
440 PRINT "SOS COMPLETE"
450 END
